### Admin Community Challenge Management Test

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7144
@adminToken = <YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE>

### 1. Create new community challenge
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/challenges
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "30-Day Running Challenge",
  "description": "Run a total of 50km in 30 days",
  "challengeType": "Workout",
  "startDate": "2025-12-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2025-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "criteria": "Complete 50km of running within 30 days and submit proof",
  "maxParticipants": 100,
  "rewardDescription": "Certificate + 20% discount coupon"
}

###

### 2. Get all challenges (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/challenges?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 3. Get challenge by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/challenges/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 4. Update challenge
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/challenges/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated: 30-Day Running Challenge",
  "status": "Open",
  "maxParticipants": 150
}

###

### 5. Get all pending approvals across all challenges (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/challenges/pending?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 6. Get pending approvals for specific challenge
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/challenges/1/pending-approvals
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 7. Review participation (approve)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/challenges/participations/1/review
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approved": true,
  "reviewNotes": "Great effort! Distance verified from running app."
}

###

### 8. Review participation (reject)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/challenges/participations/2/review
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approved": false,
  "reviewNotes": "Proof provided is not sufficient. Please resubmit with detailed logs."
}

###

### 9. Get all participants for challenge
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/challenges/1/participants
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 10. Delete challenge
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/challenges/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
